{"title":"Premium Dark","body":"<div style=\"background-color: #0f172a; padding: 40px 10px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\">\n    <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width: 620px; background-color: #1e293b; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); border: 1px solid #334155; border-collapse: separate;\">\n\n\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #090d16 0%, #0f172a 100%); padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;\">\n                <img src=\"media/com_wmacommunication/images/logo-wma-email.png\" alt=\"WMA Software Development\" width=\"180\" style=\"display: block; border: 0; margin: 0 auto 20px auto;\" />\n                <div style=\"display: inline-block; background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); border: 1px solid #10b981; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #10b981; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\">Nuova Notifica</span>\n                </div>\n                <h1 style=\"color: #f8fafc; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.5px;\">Candidatura / Messaggio Ricevuto</h1>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n\n\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 40px 35px;\">\n\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n                            <h2 style=\"font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #10b981; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-weight: 700;\">1. Dati Anagrafici & Origine</h2>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color: #0f172a; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #334155;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-bottom: 12px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Titolo Articolo / Pagina</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 600;\">{Titolo articolo}</span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b; vertical-align: top;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;\">URL Pagina</span>\n                            <a href=\"{URL pagina}\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: none; word-break: break-all;\">{URL pagina}</a>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-top: 16px; padding-bottom: 12px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Nome & Cognome</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #f8fafc; font-weight: 600;\">{Nome} {Cognome}</span>\n                        </td>\n                        <td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-top: 16px; padding-bottom: 12px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Telefono</span>\n                            <a href=\"tel:{Telefono}\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #f8fafc; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;\">{Telefono}</a>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Email</span>\n                            <a href=\"mailto:{Email}\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #10b981; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;\">{Email}</a>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n                            <h2 style=\"font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #10b981; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-weight: 700;\">2. Dettagli Candidatura</h2>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 14px;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Oggetto</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #e2e8f0; font-weight: 500;\">{Oggetto}</span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 14px;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Tipo di Candidatura & Posizione</span>\n                            <span style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #10b981; color: #0f172a; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 6px; margin-right: 8px;\">{Tipo di candidatura}</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #cbd5e1; font-weight: 600;\">{Posizioni aperte}</span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 20px;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Allegato CV</span>\n                            <div style=\"background-color: #0f172a; border: 1px dashed #334155; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 8px; display: inline-block;\">\n                                <span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8;\">📄 {Allega curriculum}</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n                            <h2 style=\"font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #10b981; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-weight: 700;\">3. Messaggio</h2>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n                <div style=\"background-color: #0f172a; border-left: 3px solid #10b981; padding: 20px; border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    {Messaggio}\n                </div>\n\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #334155; font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; text-align: right;\">\n                            Esito hCaptcha: <span style=\"color: #10b981; font-weight: 700;\">{hcaptcha}</span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n\n\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 25px; font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; background-color: #0f172a; border-top: 1px solid #334155; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                Messaggio automatico inviato tramite il form di <strong>WMA Software Development</strong>.\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</div>"}
